Maintainer: THMD-Guru OS Forge <forge@thmd-guru.academy>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://thmd-guru.academy/
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: guru-cli
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, bash (>= 5), coreutils, procps, iproute2, debianutils
Recommends: sudo, bash-completion
Description: THMD-Guru Linux unified command-line tool
 Provides the "guru" command used across all THMD-Guru Linux editions
 (Desktop, Server, ATTT). Built-in subcommands: status, info, update,
 plugins, version and help. Edition packages extend it by installing
 executable plugins into /usr/lib/guru/commands/.
